WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.004 --> 00:00:04.225
Money: record income first, then track your expenses.

2
00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:08.880
Income example: enter a name, currency, and amount of 700 USD.

3
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.995
Allocate 300 to savings. The remaining 400 is for spending.

4
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:15.646
Check the currency and date, then save the transaction.

5
00:00:15.646 --> 00:00:18.861
For a purchase, choose Expense. Each entry keeps its own currency.

6
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:22.601
Expense example: lunch, 15 USD. Choose its category.

7
00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:25.798
Review and save. This records spending; it does not make a payment.

8
00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:30.305
Both entries appear in your history. These are demo records only.
